{
  "groups": [
    {
      "all_of": [
        {
          "condition": "holds ISO 27001 certification",
          "item": "e_0037a1"
        },
        {
          "condition": "customer satisfaction rating ≥ 90%",
          "item": "e_00eba6"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "all_of": [
        {
          "condition": "records ≥ 100 successful deliveries per quarter",
          "item": "e_001bb9"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

This JSON precisely captures the logical structure required by the policy and the supporting evidence from the candidate items.
